# Adapted for dsh 0.2.2-rc.1: writeFileAtomic now takes an options object
# (options.createIfAbsent / options.displayPath) instead of positional args.
# Exclusive direct creation can expose partial content; failures retain the target.
# Node open("wx") includes O_CREAT | O_EXCL; rename would clobber a competitor.
